  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학습지 뒷면에 &nbsp;ox, 단답1,단답2, 객관식으로 4칸나눠 진행했습니다(시간관계상 객관식은 못 했어요)</span></p><p>학습지 구겨지면 어떻습니까? 잘 가지고 있으면 되지요. ^^</p><p><br></p><p style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">1. 문제 하나씩 내고</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움, Dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal;\"><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">2. 종이비행기를 동시에 날리고</span></font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움, Dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal;\"><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">3. 종이비행기 하나를 주워 답을 적고 자기이름을 적어</span></font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움, Dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal;\"><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">4. 출제자에게 가서 정답 확인 받고 점수획득</span></font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움, Dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal;\"><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">5.&nbsp;1~4과정 시간만큼 반복</span></font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움, Dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal;\"><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">6.&nbsp;조별 점수합산(양심에 맡김)</span></font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움, Dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal;\"><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">7.&nbsp;최고점수조에게 보상.</span></font></p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">굉장히 정신없는데, 애들은 정말 열심히 하네요. 재밌답니다!&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">시끄럽기만 할 줄&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">알았는데, 한 번 날린 후 두번째 문제 낼 때부터는 진짜 진지해서 내심 놀랐습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">** 당연히, 이건 제 아이디어가 아닙니다.^^ 거꾸로교실을 하시고 계신 다른 선생님의 아이디어가 여러사람을 거쳐 조금씩 변형된 것을 도입했습니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vece8YAYN9zoMjlrzNjOjNM\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vece8YAYN9zoMjlrzNjOjNM?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZlY2U4WUFZTjl6b01qbHJ6TmpPak5NIiwidGlkIjoiZGEyYzUzZGMtNGE4MS00ZjBjLThiNzYtZDgwMDgwMDMxMDYzIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTkyMjUxfQ.n4bCYZYwc-ioe7ftV9cRkFkA7tnI6jCby7aHGlchz0tE9bC6u0XAIT6YDxE1tTOo6tbUeVJShJO547Jm1kkC2A&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2106F136547492AD2D\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"gi7Ud0096vo8wvpxl4kp_9fwf0q.jpg\" style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_2106F136547492AD2D66FA\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
